{% doc %}
  Coupon field of the cart (drawer and cart page), above the totals: "קוד קופון", a text field and
  "הפעלה", then the codes on the cart as chips, each with a remove button ("הסרת הקוד X"): from
  `cart.discount_codes`, or, where Shopify's Liquid does not have it (it is missing from the Liquid
  reference), from the cart's discount applications of type discount_code. The discount lines with
  their amounts stay where they were, in the totals; a chip is the code itself, there to take it off.
  Theme setting "שדה קוד קופון בעגלה" (cart_discount_field_enabled).

  <cart-discount> (@theme/cart) saves through /cart/update.js `{ discount }`, which replaces every
  code on the cart: applying sends the codes of the chips plus the new one, removing sends the rest
  ('' removes them all). The answer's `discount_codes` says whether the new code applies. One that
  does is re-rendered with the sections like any cart change (totals, discount lines, chips) and
  "הקוד הופעל" is said; one that does not is taken off again, as Shopify's checkout does, so the cart
  never carries a code that would only come back there as an error, and "הקוד לא מתאים לסל הזה" is
  said, the code left in the field to correct. A failed request: "לא הצלחנו להפעיל את הקוד. נסו שוב."
  A code that stops applying after a later change (a minimum the cart fell under) keeps its chip,
  marked "לא מתאים לסל", while `cart.discount_codes` is there to say so; without it such a code has
  no chip and goes with the next change of codes. Messages go to the polite status line under the
  field.

  Not a form of its own: in the drawer this sits inside the cart form, and forms cannot nest. So the
  field has no name (it is never posted with the cart), the button is type=button and the script
  takes Enter, which would otherwise submit the cart form to checkout. Needs JavaScript (.js-only);
  without it the rest of the cart works as before.

  @param {string} [context] - 'drawer' (default) or 'page': the ids (stable, so focus survives the re-render).
  @param {string} [class] - Extra classes on the element.

  @example
  {% render 'cart-discount', context: 'drawer', class: 'cart-drawer__discount' %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- if settings.cart_discount_field_enabled -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign cd_id = 'CartDrawer-Discount'
    if context == 'page'
      assign cd_id = 'CartPage-Discount'
    endif

    # The codes on the cart: cart.discount_codes (each with `applicable`) where Shopify's Liquid has it, else
    # the codes of the cart's discount applications, which are the codes that apply. The ones that do not
    # apply as ",code,code," (a code cannot hold a comma: /cart/update.js splits on it).
    assign cd_codes = cart.discount_applications | where: 'type', 'discount_code' | map: 'title' | uniq
    assign cd_off = ','
    if cart.discount_codes.size > 0
      assign cd_codes = cart.discount_codes | map: 'code'
      for cd_code in cart.discount_codes
        unless cd_code.applicable
          assign cd_off = cd_off | append: cd_code.code | append: ','
        endunless
      endfor
    endif
  -%}
  <cart-discount class="cart-discount js-only{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" id="{{ cd_id }}">
    <label class="cart-discount__label" for="{{ cd_id }}-Code">{{ 'cart.discount.label' | t }}</label>
    <div class="cart-discount__field">
      <input
        class="input cart-discount__input"
        type="text"
        id="{{ cd_id }}-Code"
        dir="auto"
        autocomplete="off"
        autocapitalize="characters"
        spellcheck="false"
        enterkeyhint="go"
        aria-describedby="{{ cd_id }}-Message"
      >
      <button class="button button--outline cart-discount__apply" type="button" id="{{ cd_id }}-Apply" data-discount-apply>
        {{- 'cart.discount.apply' | t -}}
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="cart-discount__message form-message" id="{{ cd_id }}-Message" role="status" data-discount-message></p>

    {%- if cd_codes.size > 0 -%}
      <ul class="cart-discount__codes" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'cart.discount.codes_label' | t }}">
        {%- for cd_code in cd_codes -%}
          {%- assign cd_probe = ',' | append: cd_code | append: ',' -%}
          <li class="cart-discount__code{% if cd_off contains cd_probe %} is-inapplicable{% endif %}" data-discount-code="{{ cd_code | escape }}">
            {%- render 'icon', name: 'tag', size: 14 -%}
            <span dir="ltr">{{ cd_code | escape }}</span>
            {%- if cd_off contains cd_probe -%}
              <span class="cart-discount__note">{{ 'cart.discount.inapplicable' | t }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <button
              class="cart-discount__remove"
              type="button"
              data-discount-remove
              aria-label="{{ 'cart.discount.remove' | t: code: cd_code }}"
            >
              {%- render 'icon', name: 'close', size: 14 -%}
            </button>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
  </cart-discount>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .cart-discount {
    display: block;
  }

  .cart-discount__label {
    display: block;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-2xs);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .cart-discount__field {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .cart-discount__input {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .cart-discount__apply {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Printed empty and never hidden: a live region that is hidden, or appears together with its text,
     is not reliably announced. */
  .cart-discount__message:not(:empty) {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .cart-discount__codes {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    margin: var(--space-xs) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .cart-discount__code {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
    min-height: 2.25rem;
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-xs);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-brand);
    border-radius: var(--radius-badge);
    background-color: var(--color-hover-bg);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: opacity var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .cart-discount__code.is-inapplicable {
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: var(--color-border-control);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .cart-discount__note {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .cart-discount__remove {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-width: 2.25rem;
    min-height: 2.25rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-badge);
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .cart-discount__remove:hover {
      color: var(--color-error);
    }
  }

  cart-discount[aria-busy="true"] .cart-discount__code {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
